INSERT INTO questoes (id, conteudo_id, num_questao, enunciado) VALUES
    ('a53e4385-45df-40c3-90a5-98cf18499d02', 'db134338-629f-42d9-8262-7659e8d91a02', 1, $$
Assinale a alternativa que contém o sinônimo mais adequado para a palavra em destaque:  
   "The politician made a very vague promise during the campaign, which disappointed the voters."
$$),
    ('99671c46-8ed6-453f-95fa-ff275f9934da', 'db134338-629f-42d9-8262-7659e8d91a02', 2, $$
Complete a lacuna com a palavra que melhor se encaixa no contexto:  
   "Because of the heavy rain, the football match was _______ until the next day."
$$),
    ('0c6a1b24-3ba2-4d03-b9d8-f59e4af691ae', 'db134338-629f-42d9-8262-7659e8d91a02', 3, $$
Assinale a alternativa em que a palavra em inglês é um falso cognato (false friend) do português:
$$),
    ('e7bfc0ae-3e2b-496c-95b5-cc405d6d4144', 'db134338-629f-42d9-8262-7659e8d91a02', 4, $$
Assinale a alternativa que preenche corretamente a lacuna com o prefixo de sentido negativo:  
   "The instructions were _______clear, so nobody understood what to do."
$$),
    ('e3716e49-5abb-47b4-8716-a94beec8c327', 'db134338-629f-42d9-8262-7659e8d91a02', 5, $$
Em qual frase a palavra em destaque está sendo usada no sentido figurado (figurative language)?
$$),
    ('e3fa6948-560b-4c94-b380-a3b4be7dbb04', 'db134338-629f-42d9-8262-7659e8d91a02', 6, $$
Escolha a opção que melhor completa a collocation (combinação natural de palavras):  
   "I need to _______ a decision about which college to attend."
$$),
    ('44bc1d85-6953-4568-a05d-1c2870abfebf', 'db134338-629f-42d9-8262-7659e8d91a02', 7, $$
Assinale a alternativa em que a palavra substitui corretamente a expressão destacada sem alterar o sentido:  
   "My grandfather is very wealthy,  he owns three houses and a yacht."
$$),
    ('e6db1ce0-a6f0-426e-b164-451875e63735', 'db134338-629f-42d9-8262-7659e8d91a02', 8, $$
Complete a frase com o phrasal verb adequado:  
   "Please _______ your shoes before entering the house."
$$),
    ('f429385f-0163-4077-8620-4cc78a85fe20', 'db134338-629f-42d9-8262-7659e8d91a02', 9, $$
Assinale a alternativa que contém a palavra com a grafia correta (vocabulário ortográfico):
$$),
    ('02ff52cc-7f58-4166-a0c9-f4bef964d384', 'db134338-629f-42d9-8262-7659e8d91a02', 10, $$
Qual das opções abaixo é um sinônimo de "brave"?
$$),
    ('95693ffe-df93-428e-b2d0-021b6682d75d', 'db134338-629f-42d9-8262-7659e8d91a02', 11, $$
Complete a lacuna com a palavra que indica o profissional adequado:  
    "A person who designs buildings and supervises their construction is called an ______."
$$),
    ('3516c102-caf8-4b4e-8042-4ef12bb3eb45', 'db134338-629f-42d9-8262-7659e8d91a02', 12, $$
Assinale a alternativa em que o sufixo forma um adjetivo a partir do substantivo:  
    "She is a very ______ person,  she always helps others." (help)
$$),
    ('db3dabcc-0f43-44d3-b250-700fa3429281', 'db134338-629f-42d9-8262-7659e8d91a02', 13, $$
Em qual alternativa a palavra destacada tem o significado de "examinar com atenção"?  
    "The detective decided to _______ the crime scene once more."
$$),
    ('239672d2-3273-4253-b589-9900aa722ee1', 'db134338-629f-42d9-8262-7659e8d91a02', 14, $$
Assinale a opção que preenche corretamente a lacuna com o antônimo (oposto) de "ancient":  
    "The technology used in this smartphone is very ______ compared to the old models."
$$),
    ('24f4ad67-7226-4f10-97f7-313534e7b734', 'db134338-629f-42d9-8262-7659e8d91a02', 15, $$
Complete a frase com a palavra que melhor expressa a ideia de "muito cansado":  
    "After running the marathon, I was completely ______."
$$)
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;


